  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett avropskontrakt fr&#xe5;n ett ramavtal f&#xf6;r revisionstj&#xe4;nster   f&#xf6;r att konsultf&#xf6;retaget ska kunna genomf&#xf6;ra systembaserade           revisioner                                                             av ukrainska enskilda organisationer som &#xe4;r kandidater f&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. Konsultf&#xf6;retaget ska ge rekommendationer till Sida i fr&#xe5;ga om en      organisation kan hantera svenska medel p&#xe5; ett ansvarsfullt s&#xe4;tt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a call off contract from the Framework Agreement on Audits to enable a contractor to undertake system-based audits in Ukrainian     NGOs, candidates for core support. The contractor is to give Sida a   recommendation whether an organisation can spend Swedish funds in a   responsible manner.</narrative>
  </description>
